braindesk unified product icon set — attribution
================================================

The PNG icons in material/, fluent/ and papirus/ are offline
rasterisations (384px render + Lanczos downscale to 96px, full
anti-aliasing) of the SVG sources in src/, fetched 2026-11-21
by fetch_icons.py (the exact upstream path of every icon is
recorded in MANIFEST.md).

material/ — Google Material Symbols (Rounded, filled style)
  https://github.com/google/material-design-icons
  License: Apache License 2.0

fluent/ — Microsoft Fluent UI System Icons
  https://github.com/microsoft/fluentui-system-icons
  (a few icons the upstream repo does not carry under assets/
  were taken from the Iconify mirror of the same set,
  https://api.iconify.design/fluent/ - marked in MANIFEST.md)
  License: MIT License

papirus/ — Papirus Icon Theme
  https://github.com/PapirusDevelopmentTeam/papirus-icon-theme
  License: GNU General Public License v3.0

The device never parses SVG: only these pre-rendered PNGs ship,
and apps tint the monochrome sets at load time (bdicon.h).
